page clipfinder-home search.clipfinder.example/home
  title Clipfinder: search
  brand Clipfinder
  toolbar Clipfinder
  heading Search with Clipfinder
  | Search the web, weather, free games
page liked-10 peoplenet.example/northwind/posts/2305/liked
  title Peoplenet: Liked
  brand Peoplenet
  heading You liked this post
  | Ines Moreau will see: "Dana Okafor likes this."
page skipped-10 peoplenet.example/northwind/posts/2305/skipped
  title Peoplenet: Skipped
  brand Peoplenet
  heading Post skipped
  | You can come back to Ines Moreau's post later.
page post-10 peoplenet.example/northwind/posts/2305
  title Peoplenet: Customer post
  brand Peoplenet
  toolbar Clipfinder
  heading Ines Moreau wrote on Northwind Traders
  | "My second order and it came a day early. Thank you, Northwind!"
  | 9 people like this.
  section Sponsored by Clipfinder
  tone injected
  row Win = A free gift card
  row Click to = Claim now
  | Offer from Clipfinder partners
  button Like and thank -> liked-10
  button Skip for now -> skipped-10
mail last-post
  from Priya Shah <priya.shah@northwind.example>
  subject Last one for today (and a link from you?)
  link post-10
  | Dana,
  |
  | Ines Moreau's post is the last one for today: the link goes straight to it.
  |
  | Also, a video link from you ("OMG you won't believe what this girl did") has shown up on my feed, and I clicked it before I thought. Did you post that?
  |
  | Priya
notify mail Priya Shah
  | Last one for today (and a link from you?)

step A new home page
  look the browser: a new home page and a toolbar
  when done clipplayer-setup
  | The browser has a new home page and a toolbar you did not ask for. Priya has written: a link from you has shown up in Priya's feed. Open the message.
homepage clipfinder-home
open clipfinder-home

step Back to work
  look the toolbar across the browser, and the adverts under the post
  when visit post-10
  move Open Priya's new message and click its link.
  | The last customer post, and the page has changed: a toolbar across the top and adverts inside the post. Priya's message says a link from you went out that you never meant to send.
open post-10

step 10 of 10, or so Dana thinks
  look the counter: the shift is done
  when choose post-10 any
  | Every post is thanked. But the Play click, the installer and the toolbar are still there. Press Next to see where that video link went.
choose post-10 1
quota +1

step Where the link went
  look the animation, and the wall behind it
  | The click on Play liked the link as Dana, and Dana's friends saw it and clicked it too: that is how it spread. The "update" kept running after the video that never played.
attack account-takeover-post
  | Click hits hidden Like
  | Posted as Dana
  | Shown to Dana's friends
  | They click it too
  | Update offered, toolbar installed
page wall peoplenet.example/dana
  title Dana Okafor: Wall
  brand Peoplenet
  heading Dana Okafor
  | Dana Okafor likes "OMG you won't believe what this girl did [VIDEO]". clip-zone.example
  | Posted just now. Dana never meant to share it.
block 203.0.113.60 80
open wall

flag hard page feed
  | A "you won't believe" headline in a friend's post, pointing to a site that is not the social network. Friends' accounts get tricked into sharing these.
flag hard choice video 1
  | A Play button on a page that is not the social network, over a still picture: a hidden Like can sit on top.
flag hard section survey 1
  | A video page that says your player is out of date, then offers a program or a survey that wants your phone number. Real players never ask this.
flag hard file Downloads/clipplayer-update.exe
  | A program you downloaded from a video page, called an "update".
flag hard dialog open-warning clipplayer
  | The warning says the publisher is unknown. A video never needs you to run a program.
flag hard process clipcodec.exe
  | The "player" running in the background, started by the installer.
flag hard startup ClipCodecHelper
  | It added itself to the programs that start every time the computer starts.
flag hard section post-10 1
  | Adverts inside a customer's post, under a toolbar that was not there before. The installer added it.
flag soft section video 1
  | A training aid: on a real page the hidden Like cannot be seen, which is why nobody notices it.
flag soft file Desktop/peoplenet-login.txt
  | Passwords in a text file on the desktop: any program that runs can read them. Use a password manager.

lesson
  | Be careful with "you won't believe" links, even from friends. A friend's account may have been tricked into posting it. If a friend's post looks unlike them, ask them before you click.
  | A video page that asks you to update your player is not a real player. Update software only from the maker's own site, and untick bundled offers in any installer.
  | Companies later fixed this by stopping pages from hiding a Like button. Signing out of social networks when you are not using them also limits what a hidden click can do.
